'''Hollow Web Cemetery''' is a graveyard located in southern [[Gilneas]], to the west of the [[Hollow Web Woods]]. It is the final resting place of [[Mia Greymane]], queen consort of [[Genn Greymane]].<ref>{{Alliance}} [42] [[Dim Light in the Darkness]]</ref> The [[Lupine Coven]] is based out of the cemetery's crypt.

